	- Marc Vincent, PhD
</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:seeAlso>More about PROMOT initiative at https://www.promotinitiative.com/
</rdfs:seeAlso>
        <owl:versionInfo>2026-06-15</owl:versionInfo>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


