            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A type of ptosis that occurs after the external ocular muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is a ptosis apparition with repetitive external ocular muscle actions</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="fr">Une fatigabilité des muscles extra-occulaires qui provoque une ptose</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927</obo:IAO_0000117>
